{"code":"065420","name":"에스아이리소스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"석유와가스","sector_desc":"정유·가스 탐사·유통. 유가와 정제마진에 실적이 크게 흔들립니다.","desc":"동사는 1987년 설립되어 2002년 코스닥시장에 상장한 자원개발 및 유통 전문 기업임. 자원판매사업과 기타사업 부문으로 구성되며, 자원판매사업은 바이오연료 제조판매, 이탄 채굴판매, 유연탄 채굴판매로 구분됨. 바이오연료는 팜유 및 동식물성 유지계열 원료를 가공하여 국내 주요 에너지업체에 공급하고 있으며, 이탄은 러시아 사할린 Biotex-Torf社로부터 해외 독점 판권을 획득하여 국내에 유통하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":940.0,"open":940.0,"high":940.0,"low":940.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":-56.0748,"ret_120":-63.9847,"ret_250":-65.8182,"ma20":940.0,"ma60":958.0,"ma120":1507.0833,"ma200":1803.1,"close_vs_ma200":-47.8676,"close_vs_ma60":-1.8789,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-31.6985,"r2_60":0.1282,"slope_120":-93.3388,"r2_120":0.8509,"slope_250":-68.0828,"r2_250":0.6891,"high52":3880.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":24.2268,"dd_52w":-75.7732,"mdd_1y":-72.7536,"atr14_pct":64.2857,"vol_ann_60":78.6576,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":140903969.6667,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":35.7845,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":533507.0,"inst_net_60":1147.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":6.8855,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0148,"smart_net_60_pct":6.9003,"frgn_net_120":1782699.0,"inst_net_120":61147.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":23.0077,"inst_net_120_pct":0.7892,"smart_net_120_pct":23.7968,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-10.16,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-4.0,"op_margin_q":-10.5263,"op_qoq":66.6667,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-300.0,"rev_yoy":-43.2836,"op_trend_4q":16.4706,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-49.38,"debt_ratio":112.47,"per":null,"pbr":0.87,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.0,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pc